{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10301","headline":"送和西蕃使 · 皇甫曾","name":"送和西蕃使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白简初分命，黄金已在腰。\n恩华通外国，徒御发中朝。\n雨雪从边起，旌旗上陇遥。\n暮天沙漠漠，空碛马萧萧。\n寒路随河水，关城见柳条。\n和戎先罢战，知胜霍嫖姚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}